  "description": "ML.NET estimator and transformer for the EmbeddingGemma 2 text embedder (Starlings.Models.EmbeddingGemma2): a text column to a fixed-size Vector<Single, 768/512/256/128> embedding column and an optional token-count column, one inference per row however many getters are requested, explicit prompts and optional look-ahead batching. Text only. Pipeline composition only: saving the transformer is unsupported (it throws); the model is resolved from its asset lock at run time. Deployments must adhere to the Gemma Prohibited Use Policy. Maturity is per model profile (Stable, Preview or Experimental): see the README, generated from the model registry.",
